{
  "status": "answered",
  "statements": [
    {
      "text": "Set your Rapids down to 25% and then rotate to the damaged pocket press e stop once the pocket is in position.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove three pieces of sheet metal from the bottom of the cam box this larger piece to my left and also two smaller piece right below the double arm in order to gain access to the damaged pocket and the switches behind it.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before we can move this larger panel there are four of those fasteners on top of the machine we'll start with those four first.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove all the tools from the carousel and mark their location, and put a mark on the disk and on the pocket for reinstallation.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66",
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the number ring and disconnect the main air to the machine.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66",
