{
  "status": "answered",
  "statements": [
    {
      "text": "Set your rapids down to 25% and then rotate to the damaged pocket, then press e-stop once the pocket is in position.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove three pieces of sheet metal from the bottom of the cam box (one larger piece to the left and two smaller pieces right below the double arm) to gain access to the damaged pocket and the switches behind it, but remove four fasteners on top of the machine first before moving the larger panel.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove all the tools from the carousel and mark their location, putting a mark on the disk and on the pocket for reinstallation.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the number ring and disconnect the main air to the machine.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_001_5e13ba66",
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the pilot check valve, which allows moving the pocket up and down freely to reach the screw.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the four bolts from the pocket stop to continue with the removal of the pocket.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the shoulder bolt on the backside of the carousel right next to the lower proximity switch, then remove the retaining bolt and remove the pocket.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before installing the new pocket, rotate the cam follower to make sure it is spinning freely, check the plungers inside the pocket to make sure they are not worn out, and apply grease in the pocket slider.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_002_7c5bb5e7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the pocket to the slider and install both of them back in position.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_003_e05d7c5f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reinstall the retainer bolt and tighten it.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "SRC_HAAS_0005_RAW_003_e05d7c5f"
      ]
    },
